# Build output — `apps/tracy-web/Dockerfile` COPYs it into the image as `static/docs`; the CI build
# job, `scripts/rebuild-local.sh` and `pnpm --filter @tracy/docs build` write it. Never committed,
# same reasoning as `packages/web/tracy-harness/dist`.
dist/
# Astro's own cache (generated types, settings), written on the first `astro dev`/`astro build`.
.astro/
# The three pages `scripts/generate.mjs` writes from the reference tables before every build. The
# tables (`apps/tracy-web/src/api-reference/*.js`, `docs/references/api-changelog.md`) are the
# source; a committed copy would be a second truth that drifts.
src/content/docs/reference/errors.md
src/content/docs/reference/compatibility.md
src/content/docs/changelog.md
